WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.760
The Motorad Fleet appeared from the sea...

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:36.000
...and headed north, crushing cities and people before it.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.900
They call it Operation Earth Clean.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:43.000
Üso and the others...

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:46.960
...even resorted to using a nuclear blast to stop them.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:55.230
MOTHER OR SHAHKTI

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:58.360
"Mother or Shahkti".
MOTHER OR SHAHKTI

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:31.530
Commandant, the Rasteo's operations ahead of us are proceeding well, but...

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:34.260
The League Militaire are still in pursuit, I assume.

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.530
Doubtless to prevent our repairs.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:47.200
The Federation Forces stationed on Earth may not be coming after all?

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.900
It was a mistake to expect help from them.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:55.900
If we want to stop that fleet without blowing them up,

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:58.630
we'll have to take out their tires with small arms!

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.860
We need Üso and Odelo to come, too!

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.600
It would be a tastier meal without the handcuffs.

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:29.700
Be grateful for what food we can give you.

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.730
We don't have time to get any decent meals.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:35.530
If you're jealous that I get to eat a meal,

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:39.360
you'll never be able to stop the Motorad Fleet.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:44.560
You seem to think this is our only ship.

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:47.460
No, we know you're trying to drag...

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:50.300
...the Federation Forces in with the League Militaire.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.330
But they're not going to fight for you.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:55.230
Don't worry, the League Militaire is learning.

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:59.130
You learn about this, yet?

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.430
The food here doesn't agree with me.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:11.800
If this ship really is a refit of one of our Squids, then...

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.900
He's on the move. Typical impatient pilot.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:21.600
We're all set. Just pray he makes it down here.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.800
Do an energy check on the spare rifles.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.230
How's the missile pod on that Gunblaster?

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:36.760
They're repairing my Zollidia?

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:46.230
The neck ring should be international standard, but...

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:51.030
Problem with your suit?

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.530
No, it's fixed.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.460
Don't look behind you. He's here.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.730
Oh?

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:01.630
So, will he choose his own suit or choose the Victory?

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:08.430
We haven't tuned the engine on that one yet!

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:09.930
Gotcha!

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:12.060
I know all about this suit.

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.930
Sorry, but could you clear the way?

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:22.600
What's happening? What's going on?!

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:26.900
Get back! There's no point in getting stepped on here!

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:31.330
But pilot, if you attack this ship, we'll shoot you down in a second!

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:33.500
Big words!

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:36.560
I'm taking your new white suit with me, instead!

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:39.860
And you have my sympathy for your lousy food!

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.760
The monitor is dead.

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:50.200
Don't talk, Haro!

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.860
Figures he wouldn't take me.

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:55.160
Get after him, or he'll know something's up!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:55.900
Right!

00:05:57.100 --> 00:06:01.360
Most of their mobile suits are out trying to stop our fleet.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:04.630
Is that why I'm not being chased? Here comes one.

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:11.100
Don't hit him... Just make it seem like you're trying to.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:20.860
C'mon, Lupe or Katejina, notice me!

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.330
You've gotta be around here!

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:30.830
They're putting on a big show, but we have the advantage!

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.230
Trouble, Boss Man!

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:34.100
When did you learn to talk like that?

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:43.000
Dammit, Goz Barl, where have you been goofing off?

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:45.000
And you even brought reinforcements!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.630
There's no time to return to the Rasteo in the vanguard!

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:51.760
Rearm aboard the Adrastea! Damn Gundam replica!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.700
You can run away fast, I'll give you that.

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:08.300
We need to speed up our sweep operations!

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:14.460
Not so rough!

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:16.900
We finally have one of the enemy's new models!

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:18.700
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:21.930
Like you even feel pain?! Here, move up front a little.

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:25.060
Repair the left shoulder and rearm it.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:27.600
If you can't, then give me another suit.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.530
Right. I'm moving the step, now.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:30.230
Right.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:33.330
Wow, you brought us one of the white ones, undamaged.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.430
I wouldn't waste a chance when captured.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:40.460
I hope they don't find Üso, either.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:43.100
Who got this one?

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:44.900
Ensign Goz Barl.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.200
Goz Barl from Lupe Cineau's team?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.030
Yeah.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.160
Rearm my unit first!

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.030
Right!

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:53.130
Of all the selfish...

00:07:58.260 --> 00:07:59.800
Is that Commander Katejina?

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:04.060
Yep, using more energy packs and missiles than anyone else.

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:06.430
Maybe I should say hello.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:18.930
What are you doing?

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:21.200
You seem busy.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:26.060
Since the Federation Forces are concentrating on the Rasteo Fleet,

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:28.130
we're sending out reinforcements, too.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:31.430
Otherwise, the lack of mobile suits might cause problems.

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:33.560
How'd you get that mobile suit?

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:36.800
I was invited to a party by the League Militaire.

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:38.160
It's my souvenir.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.330
There's nothing we can do, now!

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:46.330
Üso, Odelo, do your best!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.960
Where are we supposed to take this cart?

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:52.000
It's not like we're doing real work on an enemy ship!

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:53.030
Hey, you!

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.800
The laundry room isn't that way.

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:57.760
Really?

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:00.730
Sorry, we're not used to this place, yet.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.300
They got kids like you working, now?

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.860
I'm in high school.

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:05.860
Come with me.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:07.630
Down this way.

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.060
Thank you!

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.130
Up.

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:12.930
Right.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:14.800
No, no!

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.960
You take that elevator down!

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:19.930
Idiot.

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:20.660
Sorry.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:29.630
There should only be one guard on this floor.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.600
I have to do something.

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:32.800
Hey!

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:34.530
Yes, sir? What is it?

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:37.760
Get these two some fatigues that fit.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:38.530
Yes, sir.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:42.860
Even if you are apprentice techs, you shouldn't dress like slobs.

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:43.930
Y-Yes, sir.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.330
Thank you, sir!

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:49.460
Here, try these on.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:50.730
How old are you?

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:51.730
Sixteen.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:54.660
Sixteen, huh? You wanna come with us?

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:57.000
Huh? What do you mean?

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.360
Could you take care of this?

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.060
Right!

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:00.530
We're leaving.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:02.600
Right, well, see you!

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:06.800
What's wrong? Did you get hit?

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.400
Where are you?

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:15.130
Hey!

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:23.400
Why build a warship like a maze?!

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.600
Maze! Maze!

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:29.300
Forget it! If we can't find it, let's set the bombs and run!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:30.530
Wait!

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.160
What's up?

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:38.530
Üso?!

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:39.430
Mom?!

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:41.800
How'd you get here?!

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:48.400
Shahkti's aboard this ship, too?

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:51.430
The Zanscare are using her.

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:54.100
Do you want her twisted to their side?

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:56.260
But we have a mission.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.730
We'll have your mom do it!

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:00.830
What? Anything I can do to help?

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:04.000
You're not just anybody, so I think you can do this.

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.230
First, take these.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.600
Plastic explosives?

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:08.760
The fuses and timers are in this.

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:12.730
They're for creating a diversion aboard so that we could escape.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:14.000
Roger.

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:16.330
But Shahkti's on a higher deck.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.200
Higher?

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.430
Right. She's a princess, after all.

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:21.060
I'll leave Haro with you.

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:23.060
What are you going to do?

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:25.100
We brought mobile suits.

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:27.700
You really are such a...

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:31.260
Mom...

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:49.300
Here we go.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:50.500
Odelo.

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:51.430
Yeah?

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:55.430
I'll set a plastic bomb to explode on this floor in two minutes.

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:56.200
Huh?

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:59.760
So that the guards don't pay attention to you.

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:01.600
Ma'am, you are incredible.

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:05.260
I'll set off more of them five or six minutes after that.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:07.600
Use Haro to contact the outside.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:08.630
Roger.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.360
Well, I'll be going then, Mom.

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:11.560
See you later.

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:26.560
Pippiniden's vanguard seems to have destroyed a Federation battleship!

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:28.700
You're sure of that?

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:30.960
Good! You have visual confirmation, right?

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:33.660
The explosion was from Officer Pippiniden's Rasteo...

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:35.530
...taking out a Federation battleship.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.600
Once we rendezvous with the third and fourth fleets,

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:41.700
conquest of North America will just be a matter of time.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:47.900
The League Militaire's fear of nuclear blasts has stayed their hand.

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:50.030
Katejina's team is moving too slowly!

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:54.060
Leave the white one for now! We'll use it later!

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.500
The Adrastea will have a white one to use?

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:13.960
If we have that new white suit, does it mean Üso won't be coming out?

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:18.560
There's more than one or two Gundams, right?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:19.800
What?!

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:25.830
I saw an explosion coming from inside the Adrastea!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:27.900
Is everything all right?

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:31.760
We are engaged in combat! All hands, remain at your posts!

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:33.460
It came from the deck below!

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:37.430
Fire fighting will be carried out by individual decks!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.300
Maintain all individual duties!

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.930
That explosion came from the inside.

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:45.160
Aren't you scared, Karl?

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.230
This is no time to be playing!

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:49.530
See?!

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:56.560
Miss Marbet, it's time. What do we do?

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:01.330
There's been no signal from Üso and Odelo!

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:06.100
Strange. The Reineforce's mobile suits...

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:08.130
...and attacks aren't as tenacious as usual.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:09.260
What's going on?!

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:13.300
An explosion from the crew's quarters?!

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:14.200
Hurry!

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:15.700
Where'd we get hit?

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.100
Don't stop!

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:19.300
Y-Yes, sir!

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:21.300
Whoops!

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:25.830
Those guards. They look like they're guarding a princess.

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:27.660
An extinguisher.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.500
Is there a fire around here?

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:31.000
It's spread over here, too!

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:32.930
Yeah! Yeah, it has!

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:34.830
I still don't see any smoke!

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.330
Fire!

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:42.400
Shahkti!

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:43.630
Üso?!

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:46.600
Run for it! My mom's helping, too.

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:47.960
Your mom, too?

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:50.460
She was being held on this ship.

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:55.300
But, I came here to persuade my uncle. I can't run away.

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:56.530
Your uncle?

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.130
Lieutenant Cronicle Asher.

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.760
Shahkti, they're coming!

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:01.760
Shahkti!

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:03.030
Here they come!

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.830
You there! What are you doing?!

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:06.600
Stay where you are!

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:10.700
One move and I'll blow the princess's head off!

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:12.060
The princess?!

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:14.030
Do what he says! Bridge!

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:17.230
Don't call anyone, or I'll start by killing the baby!

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:18.360
Y-Yeah!

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:20.460
You don't want the hostages getting shot, do you?!

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:23.730
Please, don't shoot the hostages! We won't call anyone!

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:28.200
It's just an act. I'd never use you as a shield, Shahkti.

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:29.600
But, I...

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:32.030
Don't think you're just getting out of here!

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:32.730
What's happening?!

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:33.730
Commandant!

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:41.000
That boy would never be able to shoot her!

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:42.200
Capture them all!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.830
A child couldn't hit anything with a gun!

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.160
Don't underestimate me!

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.630
Üso, I can't go back yet!

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:56.000
You're wasting your time!

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:58.500
That guy isn't open to discussing anything!

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:10.000
There they are! Aim for their legs!

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:12.330
You okay?!

00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:13.500
Sorry!

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:14.600
It's White Mask!

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:15.860
Uncle?

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.600
Let Shahkti go, Üso Ewin!

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:23.630
I said I'd shoot if you came near us!

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:27.030
Let her go, and I guarantee the lives of you and your companion.

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:29.100
Do you want Shahkti to die?!

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.860
You couldn't do it.

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:33.460
Stop pretending!

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:37.430
Shahkti! What are your intentions in this?

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:40.730
There are things I still need to discuss with you, Uncle!

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:47.260
A plastic explosive?

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:51.500
Don't turn Shahkti over to them!

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:52.330
Mom!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:53.160
Ma'am!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.860
Odelo, aim at the plastic explosives!

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:59.760
Myra Miggelle is Üso Ewin's mother?!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.600
You take after each other with your stubbornness!

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.530
If you don't want me to blow these right here,

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:08.130
then back the soldiers off!

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:11.030
You were behind those explosions before?!

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:14.960
Keep your soldiers at bay till these kids are aboard their mobile suits!

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:15.900
We're going!

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:20.860
What about her?

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:21.960
She'll be fine!

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:26.000
She'll come soon! Üso's mom is pretty amazing!

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:27.600
Everyone, return to your stations!

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.760
Let this woman go to the mobile suit deck.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:38.100
Üso and Odelo should be leaving soon!

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:38.800
R-Right!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:43.560
Haro, go!

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:47.600
Haro!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:51.600
After them!

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:52.400
Yes, sir! Yes, sir!

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:56.860
I respect a mother who wants to protect her child.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:00.760
But sometimes the egos of a father or mother...

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:03.230
...can get their children killed.

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:05.730
I hope to demonstrate this to you.

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:07.830
Okay, go!

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:13.630
Haro!

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:14.400
Haro!

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:15.060
Stop!

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:18.330
Here we go! Shahkti!

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:23.630
Launch the V2! I'll squash anyone who gets in the way!

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:29.860
Seal the mobile suit deck!

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:33.230
You're in no position to be saying that!

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:34.930
Okay... Let's go, Üso!

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:35.700
Haro!

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:41.530
Try using your vulcans or your beam saber!

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:44.960
My hatch is wide open and my armor's weak.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.660
You know what'll happen if it blows!

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:49.230
What about your mom?

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:50.700
She's fine.

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:51.800
Odelo!

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.560
Üso, we're getting out of here!

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:05.560
That girl...

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:10.460
Heil Zanscare...

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.530
She was a Zanscarist?

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:18.060
That's not what Mariaism is about, is it?!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.660
You have to save your mother, Üso!

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:31.160
Miss Katejina?!

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:34.000
It's Üso. And Shahkti's aboard, too?

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.900
I won't let you self-destruct in here!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:52.700
Form the Lysithea-class ships around us!

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.700
Have them scrape off the mobile suit clinging to us!

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:59.100
Not much profit in capturing me, was there?

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:00.300
We'll see.

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:07.730
Commandant Cronicle!

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:11.100
The white one's stuck too close! Attack is impossible!

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:13.360
Have your mobile suits force it off!

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:18.160
Why is Üso risking his life like that?!

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:23.600
Where are you?! Mom, where are you?!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:34.130
The Gundam replica!

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.260
She just...

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:39.800
Smiled?

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:43.630
Üso, if you send me back, I'll save her!

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:45.400
I'll ask my uncle!

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:47.730
Mom smiled!

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:51.730
Üso!

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:01.400
I'll get him!

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:04.660
No, you don't!

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.760
Miss Marbet!

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:21.860
Don't ask Üso about his mother when he gets back.

00:21:22.060 --> 00:21:26.360
Yeah, I won't. At least he saved Shahkti.

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:28.100
I can't stand it.

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:30.300
He's back.

00:21:37.530 --> 00:21:40.400
Üso, you should have saved her!

00:21:40.430 --> 00:21:42.700
It was my call to make!

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:47.530
I... I'm sorry, Üso.

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:53.630
Shahkti, you went to your uncle to try and help us...

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:57.230
...and I dragged you away.

00:21:57.660 --> 00:22:01.800
Maybe I'm the one who should apologize to you.

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:35.200
In a fierce battle as Miss Marbet and Shrike team...

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:39.230
...charge the Motorad Fleet to save Üso's mother,

00:23:39.860 --> 00:23:44.760
Üso witnesses a mobile suit using his mother as a shield...

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:48.000
...and a dark shadow that threatens to crush them!

00:23:49.330 --> 00:23:52.330
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.560 --> 00:23:56.630
Next Episode MOTHER, RETURN TO THE EARTH
"Mother, Return to the Earth!"

00:23:56.630 --> 00:23:58.200
Please watch it!

00:23:58.200 --> 00:23:59.530
Next Episode MOTHER, RETURN TO THE EARTH
